      "details": "<p class=\"p1\"><em>\u1e32\u0101disiyye</em>:\u00a0One of the towns of <em>\u2018Ir\u0101\u1e33</em> (Iraq).\u00a0It lies in a desert region together with \u1e2aaverna\u1e33 (Khavarnaq) and <em>\u1e24\u012bre</em> (al-\u1e24\u012bra). [translation]</p>",
